{"ticker":{"symbol":"317690.KQ","name":"퀀타매트릭스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1681.0,"change_pct":-0.02324230098779778,"market_cap":33846982656.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":5660.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://www.quantamatrix.com","business_summary":"QuantaMatrix Inc. operates as an in-vitro diagnostics company in South Korea. Its products include dRAST, a direct and rapid antimicrobial susceptibility test for treating sepsis that provides MIC-based phenotypic antimicrobial susceptibility testing direct from positive blood culture; QDST, a rapid phenotypic drug susceptibility testing system for tuberculosis; QPLEX Alz plus assay, an early diagnosis kit for Alzheimer's disease; and Quanti9 and QuantiGal, a prognostic prediction kit for cardiovascular diseases. QuantaMatrix Inc. was founded in 2010 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"QuantaMatrix Inc.는 한국에서 체외 진단 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 해당 제품에는 양성 혈액 배양에서 직접 MIC 기반 표현형 항균 감수성 테스트를 제공하는 패혈증 치료를 위한 직접적이고 신속한 항균 감수성 테스트인 dRAST가 포함됩니다. 결핵에 대한 신속한 표현형 약물 감수성 테스트 시스템인 QDST; 알츠하이머병 조기진단 키트 '큐플렉스 알츠 플러스(QPLEX Alz plus) 분석' 심혈관 질환 예후 예측 키트인 Quanti9과 QuantiGal이 있습니다. QuantaMatrix Inc.는 2010년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"의료기기","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1285933970.0,"operating_income":-20044911440.0,"net_income":-19237228770.0,"eps":-1167.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":3117941520.0,"operating_income":-22467355000.0,"net_income":-21556016710.0,"eps":-1305.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":2497118520.0,"operating_income":-16161092280.0,"net_income":-20168600440.0,"eps":-1220.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":3688305340.0,"operating_income":-1556382